     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">Tokyo.R <span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;\">関係者各位</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">お疲れ様です。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">Tokyo.R</span>運営から、次回第<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">71</span>回<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">Tokyo.R</span>についてのお知らせです。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">長文でのお知らせとなりますが、ご一読頂きますよう、</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">お願いいたします。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">----------------------------------</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\"></span>開催日について</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\"></span>発表者について</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\"></span>参加者募集について</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\"></span>参加費について</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">----------------------------------</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">■ </span>開催日について</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">前回の第<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">70</span>回<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">Tokyo.R</span>にて、開催日を<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">7/7</span>(土)とお伝えしましたが、</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">諸般の事情により、誠に勝手ながら<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">7/15</span>(日)の開催となりました。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">ご迷惑をおかけし、誠に申し訳ございません。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">奮ってご参加いただきますよう、お願いいたします。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">■ </span>発表者について</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;\">第</span>71<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;\">回</span>Tokyo.R<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;\">では、</span>Hadley Wickham<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;\">氏、</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">そして<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">Joseph Rickert</span>氏をゲストにお招きして開催いたします。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">また現在、以下枠で発表者を募集しております。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">ご希望される方は、<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">Twitter</span>の運営アカウント(<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">@TokyoRCommunity</span>)へのご連絡、</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">もしくは<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">Slack</span>の<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\"> #tokyor </span>チャンネルにて表明頂きますよう、お願いいたします。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">　・<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">15</span>分枠：<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">1</span>～<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">2</span>名</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">　・<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">5</span>分枠：～<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">5</span>名</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">なお、ゲストの都合上、発表は英語にてお願いいたします。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;\">※</span>発表希望者が多い場合は、抽選となる可能性がございます。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">■ </span>参加者募集について</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">発表者以外の参加者につきましては、</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">conpass</span>にて募集いたします。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">参加募集ページにつきましては、近々公開いたしますので、</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">今しばらくお待ちください。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">なお、参加可能枠を超える応募があった場合、</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">参加者は抽選にて決定する予定ですので、</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">ご理解頂きますよう、お願いいたします。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\"><span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">■ </span>参加費について</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">懇親会参加者からの徴収だけでは、回ごとの収支が赤字になりがちとなるため、</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">誠に勝手ながら次回より、<br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">発表中のお菓子代などを含めて、社会人の方から、</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">発表のみ参加される場合は、参加費<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">500</span>円、</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">懇親会に参加される場合は、参加費<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">1</span>,<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">500</span>円<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\"> </span>頂きたく存じます。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">また発表(<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">LT</span>含む)される方につきましては、参加費・懇親会費は無料とさせて頂きます。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">ただし、当日飛び入りで<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">LT</span>される方につきましては、対象外とさせて頂きます。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">ご理解・ご協力を何卒よろしくお願いいたします。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">なお、次回の<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">Tokyo.R</span>では、</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">参加費・懇親会費は<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">Paypal</span>にて事前徴収とさせて頂きます。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">ご理解・ご協力をよろしくお願いいたします。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">お知らせは以上となります。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">次回<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">Tokyo.R</span>へのご参加を心よりお待ち申し上げます。</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69);min-height:14px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;color:rgb(69,69,69)\">Tokyo.R <span style=\"font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface&quot;\">運営チーム</span></p></div>"
